<title>USA: U.S. weekly national grain stocks by region - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. weekly national grain stocks by region - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND 1996-10-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>National stocks of grain, in thousand bushels, as reported by the USDA.</p>
<p>		   Wheat   Corn  Soybeans Pct filled</p>
<p> Atlantic cst    2533   1086    1164    47</p>
<p> Great Lakes    30652   1094    7060    23</p>
<p> River Points   17821   6923   18843    27</p>
<p> Southwest	17014   8336     594    19</p>
<p> Gulf Points    19635   4843    3727    32</p>
<p> Plains Area    37372   9649    2339    23</p>
<p> Pacific NW     11233   1013     unq    39</p>
<p> Grand Total   136260  32944   33727    25</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-983-7278--</p>
